        48.08995819091797,
        312.3354187011719,
        443.6111145019531,
        323.94720458984375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "which is typically deﬁned on a much smaller space. It is natural to propose a particle approxima-",
      "bbox": [
