        325.1275939941406,
        443.61004638671875,
        334.3629150390625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "tion to the MMH update where, whenever a sample from pθ.x1:T |y1:T / and the expression for",
