        168.24725341796875,
        399.5026550292969
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "(a) set θ.0/ arbitrarily and",
      "bbox": [
        66.94754791259766,
        406.94866943359375,
        179.38941955566406,
        417.0208740234375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "(b) run an SMC algorithm targeting pθ.0/.x1:T |y1:T /, sample X1:T .0/∼ˆpθ.0/.·|y1:T / and let",
      "bbox": [
        66.94755554199219,
